OL,5,G2100 The Chase Around the World
OL,6,     FThe teams land in the final city,
OL,7,     FAthens, where they must take on
OL,8,     Fand defeat all the Chasers in
OL,9,     Fhead-to-head battles across the
OL,10,     Fregion. Competition is fierce, and
OL,11,     Fthe race begins at dawn at the
OL,12,     FAcropolis. As the sun rises, there
OL,13,     Fare clashes with the Chasers in an
OL,14,     FAthenian temple, and the shadow of
OL,15,     Fthe Olympic stadium, a
OL,16,     Fplate-smashing quiz in a Greek
OL,17,     Ftaverna, and a skilful
OL,18,     Fstone-carving test before a
OL,19,     Fdramatic dash to find Bradley
OL,20,     FWalsh at the finish line
